<?xml version="1.0"?>
<package >
  <metadata>
    <id>Cocos2D-Mono.Core.Windows</id>
    <version>2.5.10</version>
    <icon>images\logo-small.png</icon>
    <readme>docs\README.md</readme>
    <title>Cocos2D-Mono for Core Windows</title>
    <authors>Cocos2D-Mono Team, Broken Walls Studios</authors>
    <owners>Cocos2D-Mono Team, Broken Walls Studios</owners>
    <license type="expression">AGPL-3.0-only</license>
    <projectUrl>https://github.com/Cocos2D-Mono/cocos2d-mono</projectUrl>
    <iconUrl>https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1112234186457473024/G7S7ARjA_400x400.png</iconUrl>
    <requireLicenseAcceptance>true</requireLicenseAcceptance>
    <description>Cocos2D-Mono for Core Windows (DX)</description>
    <repository url="https://github.com/Cocos2D-Mono/cocos2d-mono" />
    <releaseNotes>
2.5.10 - Modernization &amp; hardening release (runtime unchanged: .NET 9 / MonoGame 3.8.4.1).
- BREAKING: removed the custom Cocos2D.ArrayPool&lt;T&gt;; CCRawList&lt;T&gt; now pools via System.Buffers.ArrayPool&lt;T&gt; (the public UseArrayPool option is unchanged)
- Fixed a CCDirector.SharedDirector lazy-init race that could expose a half-initialized director under concurrent first access
- Fixed CCInputState per-frame delta time, CCTouchDelegate handler lookup (no longer throws on an unregistered event), and CCRawList.PackToCount buffer ownership
- CCRawList pooling is now backed by System.Buffers.ArrayPool (~21% faster, near-zero allocation on the pooled path)
- Removed all dead platform code (WINDOWS_PHONE/XBOX/XBOX360/PSM/WP8/SILVERLIGHT/PCL and NETFX_CORE/WINRT/WINDOWS_UWP); deleted Tuple.cs and b2FlagExtensions.cs; ArrayList/Hashtable -> generics
- Added a unit-test suite and a BenchmarkDotNet project, plus an .editorconfig baseline
    </releaseNotes>
    <copyright>Copyright © 2026 Cocos2D-Mono Team; Broken Walls Studios, LLC.</copyright>
    <tags>mono monogame cocos2d game</tags>
    <dependencies>
     <group targetFramework="net9.0-windows7.0">
        <dependency id="BitMiracle.LibTiff.NET" version="2.4.639" exclude="Build,Analyzers" />
        <dependency id="MonoGame.Framework.WindowsDX" version="3.8.4.1" exclude="Build,Analyzers" />
        <dependency id="SharpZipLib" version="1.4.2" exclude="Build,Analyzers" />
        <dependency id="System.Drawing.Common" version="8.0.11" exclude="Build,Analyzers" />
      </group>
    </dependencies>
  </metadata>
  <files>
